mlx-flashvsr-swift
Port of FlashVSR (https://github.com/OpenImagingLab/FlashVSR @ cf910c61a60733e610e9c6e8b607f80c3a6c202b):
  FlashVSR authors (OpenImagingLab). Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
FlashVSR's pipeline code builds on DiffSynth-Studio (https://github.com/modelscope/DiffSynth-Studio):
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The DiT is the Wan2.1 architecture (https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.1): Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The TCDecoder derives from TAEHV (https://github.com/madebyollin/taehv): Copyright (c) Ollin Boer Bohan, MIT License.

The FlashVSR v1.1 weights (https://huggingface.co/JunhaoZhuang/FlashVSR-v1.1) are Apache-2.0 from their authors and
are not included in this repository. MLX-layout conversions (oracle/convert_weights.py) are published at
https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/FlashVSR-v1.1-bf16 and https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/FlashVSR-v1.1-fp32.
